omx-plugins (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release 0.4.0: libomxplugins; version and changelogs
  * docs: BUILDING and README describe libomxplugins and its table (#98)
  * packaging: the devel packages ship libomxplugins.a and omxplugins.pc (#98)
  * recipe: every plugin is listed in libomxplugins' table (#98)
  * test: a C host links libomxplugins through omxplugins.pc and opens every
    plugin (#98)
  * build: make builds libomxplugins.a and install-devel installs it with
    omxplugins.pc (#98)
  * lib: the static table lists every shipped plugin's CLAP entry (#98)
  * tools: gen fills libomxplugins' table of CLAP entries from every shipped
    plugin (#98)
  * docs: the Zynthian tarball, where it comes from and where its bundles go
  * release: a Zynthian tarball repacked from the bookworm arm64 DEBs

 -- Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>  Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:14:45 +0000
